WEBVTT

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.400
This card activates when it's 
destroyed and sent to the graveyard.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.400
I activate the spell card Z-ONE's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:46.850
I'll use the power of the card that 
my father left me to bury you!

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.340
Wait, Sherry!  Why are you doing this?

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:56.290
You never cheated in 
duels until now!  So why?

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:00.290
I'm here to get my family back!

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.280
Get your family back?

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.950
What do you mean?

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.210
What wish did you ask Z-one to grant?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.020
My wish was...

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:17.530
I can use my power to change the past.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:18.910
Really?

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.080
Yes.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:24.030
In that case, I'll help with your plan.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.340
But in exchange, you must 
promise to fulfill my wish.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:33.310
If you help me, you and Yusei 
Fudo will become enemies.

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:38.290
I don't care.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.210
I've made my decision!

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:44.170
In that case, I'll give you power.

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:49.010
I'll defeat you here.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.310
By doing so, Z-one's power 
will change my past!

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:56.110
I'll once again have a 
peaceful life with my family!

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.280
Sherry...

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:02.610
You're willing to destroy Neo Domino 
City to get your family back?

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:06.370
I learned that there's no hope in the future!

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:11.720
So I at least want to 
get my lovely past back.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:18.610
Due to Z-ONE's effect, I remove the Field 
Spell Soul Binding Gate in my deck from play!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:19.570
What?

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:23.790
Z-ONE now acts as Soul Binding 
Gate and activates on the field!

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:29.140
Furthermore, when this effect places Z-ONE 
on the field, it can't be destroyed!

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.510
Sherry!

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:54.900
This is Soul Binding Gate.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:03:02.790
Even if it costs me my life, I won't 
let you take a step past this gate!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.200
Riding Duels.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.280
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:16.170
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:23.950
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:28.350
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:45.440
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:51.040
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:56.450
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:57.020 --> 00:04:02.990
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:08.360
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:14.200
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:21.970
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:27.350
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:32.880
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:38.420
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:45.460
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:05.850
Soul Binding Gate!  Sealed Future!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:13.210
Sherry, you're willing to risk 
your life to change the past?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.580
Sherry...

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:17.520
Be quiet!  The duel is still going on!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.770
Aki Izayoi, it's your turn.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.890
I summon Crystal Rose Spirit.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.540
I tricked you.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:35.100
I activate Soul Binding Gate's 
effect that Z-ONE copied!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:39.420
Since you summoned a monster with fewer 
attack points than my life points...

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:44.090
...that card is destroyed, and all 
players take 800 points of damage!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:59.760
Z-ONE's effect makes us feel pain?

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:06.700
Even if it takes away her own life, she's 
trying to defeat us with actual damage.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:12.410
That's right.  No matter how hard you try, 
you can't pass through these gates of hell.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.830
Soul Binding Gate has an incredible effect.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.760
Sherry has 3200 life points.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:23.880
It's difficult to summon a monster 
with at least 3200 attack points.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:28.430
I'll have to use Soul Binding Gate's effect 
to shave away Sherry's life points first.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:32.140
But that will also shave 
away Aki and my life points.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:36.850
If Soul Binding Gate's effect activates 
twice, Aki's life points will drop to 0.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:40.080
Crow, don't worry about me.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.820
You must only think about 
moving past this place!

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:43.880
But-

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.280
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:48.260
Please, Crow.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.020
My turn!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:53.170
What should I do?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:59.090
If there aren't any Synchro Monsters on the 
field, Hurricane the Tornado has 0 attack points.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.590
It's pointless to play it right now.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.270
Therefore, I'll...

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.970
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:06.380
Crow...

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.140
Do you really think that 
will protect your teammate?

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.200
My turn!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:16.780
I summon the flower of death Necro Fleur!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:25.520
Due to Soul Binding Gate's effect, Necro Fleur is 
destroyed, and all players take 800 points of damage!

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:36.000
Aki, are you okay?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:36.950
Yeah.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:40.140
Necro Fleur's effect activates!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:47.650
When an effect destroys this card, I can 
Special Summon Sorciere de Fleur from my deck!

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.750
2900 attack points!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.290
Soul Binding Gate's effect won't activate.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:08:01.580
But if it attacks directly, either 
Aki or I will be defeated.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.440
My strategy isn't that simple.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.570
Sorciere de Fleur's effect activates!

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:14.100
I can Special Summon your monster that was 
sent to the graveyard last turn on to my field!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:19.390
I Special Summon Crystal Rose Spirit 
from Aki Izayoi's graveyard!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.320
No way!  My monster!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:29.890
Due to Soul Binding Gate's effect, 
Crystal Rose Spirit is destroyed!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.490
All players take 800 points of damage.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:38.650
Goodbye, Aki Izayoi.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:42.120
I'll defeat Crow right after you.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.150
I won't let that happen!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.110
I flip over my trap Chaos Life!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.680
When a card effect's damage lowers 
the life points to 0, that

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:55.100
damage is negated, and we regain 
life points equal to that damage!

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.330
What?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.960
We won't be defeated that easily.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:06.060
But Sorciere de Fleur can still attack.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.490
I'll defeat you first.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.150
Attack Crow directly!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.000
I won't let that happen!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.780
I flip over my trap card Crystal Veil!

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:22.110
By removing a Light Attribute monster 
in my graveyard from play, your

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:26.030
attack is negated, and you take damage 
equal to half its attack points!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.060
I remove Crystal Rose Spirit in my graveyard

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:33.230
from play, so Sorciere de 
Fleur's attack is negated!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:37.420
You take damage equal to half of Crystal Rose

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.350
Spirit's attack points 
for 700 points of damage!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.060
You saved me, Aki.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.310
Same here.

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.410
I'm safe thanks to you, Crow.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:53.400
You're celebrating just because 
you survived one turn?

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.910
Soul Binding Gate can't be defeated!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.150
You will definitely lose!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:04.850
Sherry, stop this dangerous duel!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:07.140
There's no reason why we 
should hurt each other!

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.350
I will change the past.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.850
If you had the chance, you would do the same.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.190
What are you talking about?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.330
No, I wouldn't!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.290
Can you truly say that?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.660
I'll show you Z-one's power!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.410
What?

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:36.150
Where are we?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.480
Hey!

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:38.860
Daichi!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:39.870
Ginga!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.510
Mom!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:41.490
Dad!

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.430
What's this?

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:52.320
This is how Z-one's power 
would change the world.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:55.800
This is what you desire deep in your psyche.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.870
My psyche?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:03.830
Crow, what you truly desire is a world 
where Zero Reverse didn't occur.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:09.770
A world where your orphans can live 
happily with their real families.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:10.750
What?

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.220
Children with their real families?

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:18.660
That's right.  If this is what you desire, 
those children can get their parents back.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.910
What do you mean?

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.620
Surrender this duel and join me.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:29.700
If you do, Z-one will make 
this world a reality.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.610
They'll have families...

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.310
I end my turn.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.870
Crow, don't let Sherry mislead you!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:49.350
We came here to save Neo Domino 
City and keep Yusei alive!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:50.800
Aki...

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:54.450
If it was possible, I'd want 
to save those children too.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:12:01.030
But if we give up, the city will be 
destroyed, and many people will lose their lives.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:07.380
Do you think those children would want that 
future in exchange for getting back their parents?

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:11.680
My turn!

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:13.750
This is...

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.280
If I can use this with Crow...

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.200
In order to do that...

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.500
I summon Blue Rose Dragon!

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:26.650
Aki?

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:30.890
You fool!  Due to Soul Binding 
Gate's effect, Blue Rose

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.540
Dragon is destroyed, and everyone 
takes 800 points of damage!

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:43.240
When Blue Rose Dragon is 
destroyed, I can Special

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:47.460
Summon Black Rose Dragon from my 
graveyard without its effects!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.300
Sherry, you're down to 1700 life points.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.880
Therefore, Soul Binding Gate's 
effect doesn't activate!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:57.080
Not bad.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.830
Crow, I leave the rest to you.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.860
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.220
Think carefully, Crow!

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:13.120
Will you continue this duel 
when you have no chance of

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:17.880
winning, or will you give up and 
get the children's parents back?

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:20.070
Which is the wiser choice?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:26.750
I know how tough it is not to 
have a family, and they know too.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:27.710
Crow!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:32.690
Aki, I don't want to hurt 
you either!  Therefore...

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.320
Aki Izayoi only has 350 life points.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:41.690
If you summon a monster with less than 1700 
attack points, due to Soul Binding Gate's effect...

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.070
Aki will lose.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.060
Listen, Crow!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:55.050
Yusei saved me from the 
darkness of my psychic powers.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:00.710
He wasn't concerned about his own safety 
and risked his life to persuade me.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:07.270
My psychic powers are now 
gone, so I'm renewed.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.410
That's when I thought...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:15.460
As long as I believe in my own 
potential, I can change the future!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.870
Change the future...

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:22.890
That's right!  Those children also 
believe in the future and fight to live!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.430
They're not sad!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.150
Crow, you were the same!

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.640
That's right.  They're 
just like me in the past.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:37.360
Just like how Yusei, Jack and 
I stayed and lived together.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.270
Sorry, everyone.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.390
I was about to make a dangerous mistake.

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.770
Crow...

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:53.030
You're giving up your chance 
to change the past, Crow?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.720
I believe in their future!

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.960
And the future of this city!  And Yusei!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.870
My turn!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.320
How will I overcome this situation?

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:07.520
Aki has 350 life points left.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.400
If Soul Binding Gate's effect 
activates, it's over.

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:15.850
So why did Aki take away her own life points 
in order to summon Black Rose Dragon?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.200
Why would she take that dangerous risk?

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.080
Can it be that the card is...

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.430
I see!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:25.210
Aki, I also believe in you!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.620
I flip over my trap card Blackback!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:32.290
I can Special Summon a Blackwing from my 
graveyard with 2000-or-fewer attack points!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.610
However, I can't Normal 
Summon a monster this turn!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:40.860
I Special Summon Blackwing - Bora 
the Spear with 1700 attack points!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.180
Its attack points are the same as your life

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.530
points, so Soul Binding Gate's 
effect doesn't activate!

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:53.100
I activate the spell card Rendering Tuning!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.090
I can Special Summon a 
Tuner Monster from my hand!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:16:00.060
I Special Summon Blackwing 
- Hurricane the Tornado!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:08.620
Hurricane the Tornado has the same number of 
attack points as a Synchro Monster on the field!

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:12.670
Therefore, its attack points are the same 
as Black Rose Dragon's 2400 attack points!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.840
Soul Binding Gate's effect doesn't activate!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.980
What?

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:20.430
I activate the spell card Level Wing!

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:24.460
One of my monsters gains 3 Levels!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.730
Hurricane the Tornado's 
Level increases from 1 to 4!

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:33.320
Level 4 Hurricane the Tornado 
tunes Level 4 Bora the Spear!

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:38.700
Black whirlwind, your secret 
thoughts appear on your wings!

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:40.230
Synchro Summon!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.730
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.990
Whatever you try, it's all a waste!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:53.420
I'll use the power of my father's card 
to change the past into a peaceful world!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.300
That's enough, Sherry!

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:58.880
Did your father leave you 
that card to do this?

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.840
Be quiet!  I want to meet 
my father and mother!

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:07.620
I want them to hug and caress 
me with their large, kind hands!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:10.810
What's bad about that?  
What's wrong about that?

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.260
Why can't you understand, Sherry!

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:18.700
We work hard to live because 
we only get one chance at life!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:21.890
There's no point in returning to the 
past and doing things differently!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.500
No matter how many painful or 
sad events we go through, you

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:29.230
have to believe in the future 
and live strong in the present!

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.350
Be quiet!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.950
There's only one way left to save you.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:50.020
Black-Winged Dragon, 
attack Sorciere de Fleur!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.660
That's pointless!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.930
Sorciere de Fleur has 2900 attack points!

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:57.290
Your Black-Winged Dragon isn't strong enough!

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:00.490
I told you that we will change the future!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.760
Yes, I was waiting for this moment.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:06.820
I activate my trap Synchro Stream!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.890
When there are at least two 
Synchro Monsters on the field,

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:14.200
one Synchro Monster's attack 
points are added to the other!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.300
What?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.950
Yeah!  I believed in you, Aki!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.670
Sherry, it's time to wake up!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:24.530
Go, Black-Winged Dragon 
and Black Rose Dragon!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.100
The gear stopped.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.110
Sherry!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.130
Crow!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.680
Those shockwaves were...

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.100
Did the Yusei Gear stop?

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.670
All right, it's our turn!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.480
Crow and Aki, you did it!

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:22.680
Yusei, let's hurry!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.120
Yeah!

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:32.110
Sherry...

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.980
That's my father's voice.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.340
Sherry, listen carefully to what I say.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:49.990
In the future, there may be painful 
and sad events in your life.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.430
But you must not falter.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:56.780
You must live without letting your 
sense of faith and justice waver.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.980
And that will open your future.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:06.970
That's right.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:12.520
My father left me this so 
that I would live strong.

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.990
But I didn't.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:20.450
I'm sorry, Father.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.140
What happened?

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.340
What's this?

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.620
Black Rose Dragon protected us.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:43.070
When I wished to save you 
both, Black Rose Dragon...

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.100
Is this psychic power?

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.420
It's warm.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.500
Maybe true psychic power is to heal people.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.630
The power to heal people...

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:11.460
Everything I did was horrible.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.280
Sherry, it's not too late to change.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.930
Let's change the future together!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.040
Change the future?

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.600
Yeah.  Let's save the city and Yusei.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.570
Crow...  Aki...

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:31.610
You must live without letting your 
sense of faith and justice waver.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:36.240
Understood.  I'll go with you.

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:42.900
Let's go.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:45.550
Yusei is waiting for us at the Sun Gear!

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:46.730
Right.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:11.780
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:17.150
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:22.520
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.260
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:30.500
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:37.140
We'll find a place for us

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.880
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:48.950
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:55.120
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:55.120 --> 00:23:03.700
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:09.300
We will draw it forever
